م ياودود </b></div><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"secure(th.tweet)\"><b>سلام ربي لكل واحد وكل موجود </b></div><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"secure(th.tweet)\"><b>وصلاة ربي وسلامٌ على النبي المحمود</b></div><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"secure(th.tweet)\"><b> وهنا صورة من <a class=\"notranslate\" href=\"https://rattibha.com/hashtag/%D9%85%D9%8A%D8%AA%D8%B4%D9%88%D8%A8%D9%8A%D8%AA%D8%B4%D9%88\">#ميتشوبيتشو</a> </b></div><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"secure(th.tweet)\"><br/></div><div class=\"ccc light-opacity mb-2 ng-scope\" ng-if=\"th.tweet.media != null &amp;&amp; th.tweet.media.length &gt; 0\"><div class=\"img zoom ng-scope\" ng-repeat=\"med in th.tweet.media\"><div afkl-lazy-image=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FO3xAghX0AgP6Gl.jpg\" afkl-lazy-image-loaded=\"done\" afkl-lazy-image-options=\"{'offset': 10, 'nolazy': true, 'imgAttrs': [{'class': 'img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow', 'alt': 'img', 'onerror': 'arguments[0].currentTarget.style.display=\\'none\\''}]}\" class=\"imgload\" ng-click=\"showImage()\" ng-show=\"med.type == 2\"><img class=\"img-fluid img-fluid1 fadein-special box-shadow afkl-lazy-image\" src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FO3xAghX0AgP6Gl.jpg\"/></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4 pb-4 border-top pt-4\" ng-show=\"!threadUpdate &amp;&amp; !thread_loading &amp;&amp; !main_loading\"><br/></div><div class=\"mb-4 pb-4 border-top pt-4\" ng-show=\"!threadUpdate &amp;&amp; !thread_loading &amp;&amp; !main_loading\"><b>تحياتي </b></div><div class=\"mb-4 pb-4 border-top pt-4\" ng-show=\"!threadUpdate &amp;&amp; !thread_loading &amp;&amp; !main_loading\"><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-html=\"secure(th.tweet)\"><b><a class=\"notranslate\" href=\"https://rattibha.com/hashtag/%D8%B1%D8%AD%D8%A7%D9%84_%D9%88%D8%A7%D8%A6%D9%84_%D8%A7%D9%84%D8%AF%D8%BA%D9%81%D9%82\">#رحال_وائل_الدغفق</a> </b></div><div class=\"tweet mt-2 ng-binding\" ng-bind-